        {
          "text": "Their extravagance and complicated details didn’t disguise the fact that these were cages; they glorified it",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6239
        }
      ],
      "words": 16
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Yet she is alone, and she can’t bring back her species. She will never know another like her, and she will never know t",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9216
        }
      ],
      "words": 39
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Because we’ve ruined their home, and we must accept that this one, we couldn’t save.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9445
        },
        {
          "text": "“All of them. We’ve let them all down.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9583
        }
      ],
      "words": 24
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Do you want to be remembered?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10359
        },
        {
          "text": "“No,” she said",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10465
        },
        {
          "text": "“I think some damage can never be undone, so there is no point.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10532
        }
      ],
      "words": 24
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I looked down at my arm, then bent my elbow in her direction",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5378
        },
        {
          "text": "Fingers wrapped around my arm",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5576
        },
        {
          "text": "While it was one interaction, it felt like I’d done something right",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5660
        }
      ],
      "words": 32
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "It wasn’t death I looked forward to anymore. A new momentum was growing inside me, an urge to discover",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 11724
        },
        {
          "text": "But not for me, for her",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 11827
        }
